IRREDUCIBLE PRIME CARRIER TOURNAMENT ATLAS
==========================================
Sources:
  Singh arXiv:2411.18366 - prime factorization of large values bounds factors.
  Iravanian arXiv:2410.15880 - real-factor recombination becomes subset-sum.

